<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tenneco lowered by Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tenneco lowered by Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Joel Tiss  downgraded Tenneco Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said in a report that &quot;even including further strength in paper  prices, the shares look nearly fully valued and reflect the fundamental  improvements now underway.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was up 3/8 at 47.</p>
</text>
